---
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
title: "Add a case study"
description: "Share your community health activation story with the Healthier UK Casebook. Entries are reviewed by the editorial team before they are published."
permalink: "/submit-casebook.html"
section: "casebook"
cta: false
---

  <div class="page-header" id="casebook-intro">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <a href="casebook.html">Casebook</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span class="current">Add a case study</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Healthier UK Casebook</h1>
      <p class="lead">Complete this template to share your community health activation story.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">

      <div class="card mb-5" id="casebook-steps" style="background-color:var(--color-bg-alt); border-left:4px solid var(--color-accent-salmon);">
        <h3>What happens after you submit</h3>
        <ol style="margin:0.75rem 0 0; padding-left:1.35rem; list-style:decimal;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">Your case study goes to the Healthier UK editorial team &mdash; it does not appear on the site straight away.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">We read it, and may come back to you with small suggestions.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:.4rem;">Once approved it appears in the Casebook for anyone to read and learn from.</li>
        </ol>
        <p style="margin:0.9rem 0 0; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--hu-text-muted);">
          It does not have to be a success story. What did not work, and why, is often the
          most useful thing you can tell someone starting out.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form id="casebook-form" class="contribute-form" novalidate>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>The project</h2></legend>

          {# 50 characters, applied silently: the field simply stops accepting more. #}
          <div class="field">
            <label for="title">Name of project <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="title" name="title" required maxlength="50">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="town">Town or city <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="town" name="town" required maxlength="60" placeholder="Guildford">
            <p class="hint">Where it happened. If it covered a wider area, name the main town or the district.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="region">Region <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <select id="region" name="region" required>
              <option value="">Choose a region&hellip;</option>
              {% for r in casebookRegions %}<option value="{{ r.slug }}">{{ r.name }}</option>
              {% endfor %}
            </select>
            <p class="hint">Used to group entries by place, so people can find work near them.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="image">A picture of the project</label>
            <input type="file" id="image" name="image" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">
            <p class="hint">Optional. JPG or PNG, up to 5MB. Please only send pictures you have permission to use, and avoid identifiable children.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>The story</h2></legend>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="population">Population <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="population" name="population" rows="5" required maxlength="900" data-wordlimit="100"
                      placeholder="Describe your community or population group — age, location, demographics, size."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="population">0</span> of 100 words</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="healthChallenge">Health challenge <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="healthChallenge" name="healthChallenge" rows="5" required maxlength="900" data-wordlimit="100"
                      placeholder="What specific health issue or challenge did your community wish to improve?"></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="healthChallenge">0</span> of 100 words</p>
          </div>

          {# 100 characters, applied silently. #}
          <div class="field">
            <label for="organisations">Key organisations</label>
            <input type="text" id="organisations" name="organisations" maxlength="100"
                   placeholder="Partner organisations, stakeholders and collaborators">
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="actions">Actions taken <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="actions" name="actions" rows="10" required maxlength="2200" data-wordlimit="250"
                      placeholder="Describe the interventions, programmes or activities you put in place."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="actions">0</span> of 250 words</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="outcomes">Outcome/s <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="outcomes" name="outcomes" rows="10" required maxlength="2200" data-wordlimit="250"
                      placeholder="What were the measurable results and impacts? Include data where you can."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="outcomes">0</span> of 250 words</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="lessons">Lessons learned <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="lessons" name="lessons" rows="10" required maxlength="2200" data-wordlimit="250"
                      placeholder="Key insights, challenges you overcame, and what you would tell someone doing this next."></textarea>
            <p class="hint"><span class="wordcount" data-for="lessons">0</span> of 250 words</p>
          </div>

          {# 100 characters, applied silently. #}
          <div class="field">
            <label for="furtherReading">Further reading</label>
            <input type="text" id="furtherReading" name="furtherReading" maxlength="100"
                   placeholder="A report, a web page or an evaluation">
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-block">
          <legend><h2>Contact</h2></legend>

          {# 50 characters, applied silently. This one is published. #}
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contact">Contact shown on the page</label>
            <input type="text" id="contact" name="contact" maxlength="50"
                   placeholder="Jane Smith, Active Guildford">
            <p class="hint">Shown publicly, so that someone who wants to do the same thing can find you. Leave it blank if you would rather not be contacted.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="submitterEmail">Your email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="email" id="submitterEmail" name="submitterEmail" required autocomplete="email">
            <p class="hint">Only used so the editorial team can come back to you about this entry. It is never published.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="field field-check">
          <input type="checkbox" id="consent" name="consent" required>
          <label for="consent">I am happy for Healthier UK to publish this case study, including the contact details above, and I have permission to share what is in it. <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        </div>

        <div id="turnstile-holder" data-sitekey=""></div>

        <p class="form-error" id="casebook-error" role="alert" hidden></p>

        <div class="btn-group" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="casebook-submit-btn">Send for review</button>
          <a href="casebook.html" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Back to the casebook</a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="casebook-success" class="card" hidden
           style="text-align:center; padding:3.5rem 2rem; background-color:var(--color-bg-alt);">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Thank you</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--hu-text-muted); max-width:46ch; margin:0 auto 1.75rem;">
          Your case study has gone to the Healthier UK editorial team. We will be in touch at
          the email address you gave us. Nothing appears in the Casebook until it has been reviewed.
        </p>
        <a href="casebook.html" class="btn btn-accent">Back to the casebook</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
